From 5f1c0c8cff9ff5b58f607374ac775a8b49153be1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HolyCode User <noreply@holycode.local>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:07:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] feat(inbounds)!: remove subscription ordering and
 exclusion

Drop subSortIndex and excludeFromSub from the inbound model, API, UI, and storage. Subscription links now follow inbound id. Add a migration that removes the retired columns.
